    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Worlds of Parallela</u>\u00a0is a unique platformer roguelike where agility and resourcefulness are valued for survival over strength. Play as the mysterious Cloak Guy - an ex-thief turned tailor on the run from law enforcement due to his criminal past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724680/extras/ba2c9d317c08d5adbc3642d2a5245e38.poster.avif?t=1730255979\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724680/extras/ba2c9d317c08d5adbc3642d2a5245e38.webp?t=1730255979\" class=\"bb_img\" width=585 height=359 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724680/extras/081ed0bc03541fcf17b382fc05d5a543.poster.avif?t=1730255979\" width=584 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724680/extras/081ed0bc03541fcf17b382fc05d5a543.webm?t=1730255979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724680/extras/081ed0bc03541fcf17b382fc05d5a543.mp4?t=1730255979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While seeking shelter, Cloak Guy stumbles into a strange place where death cannot exist, and every parallel universe has merged into one. He finds himself interacting with his parallel counterparts.. whether both parties like it or not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only must Cloak Guy conquer harsh conditions, dangerous monsters and maze-like dungeons to escape PARALLELA - he must also conquer himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 